      "@type": "http://www.w3id.org/pdto#DisposalInstruction",
      "http://schema.org/description": "Separate sofa components for proper disposal. - Upholstery fabric: recycle if textile recycling facilities available; otherwise, dispose according to local regulations. - Wooden frame: send to wood recycling or energy recovery if recycling unavailable. - Cushions: foam can be recycled if supported; otherwise, dispose safely. - Metal fasteners and connectors: recycle as scrap metal. Ensure components are dismantled and sorted to maximize recycling and minimize landfill.",
